      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>An action that signals a request for the companion app to change its nearby advertising state.</para>
          <para>When the system sends this request, the app receives a callback to CompanionDeviceService.onActionRequested(AssociationInfo,ActionRequest) with this constant.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/companion/ActionRequest#REQUEST_NEARBY_ADVERTISING" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.companion.ActionRequest.REQUEST_NEARBY_ADVERTISING</code>.</a></format></para>
